    // WHERE A TOOLTIP SITS (design pass, 2026-10-20). Pure, so a test pins
    // it. The usual practice (Floating UI's placement, flip and shift): a
    // preferred side, flipped to the opposite side when that side has no
    // room, then slid along its edge to stay on screen, but never so far
    // that it stops touching its target.
